{
  "key": 46143,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_PostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re better than I thought.\n",
        "Go on ahead.\r",
        "You only got a taste of the\n",
        "Pokémon League’s power."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Pokémon League.\r",
        "I am Lorelei of the Elite Four.\r",
        "No one can best me when it comes\n",
        "to icy Pokémon.\r",
        "Freezing moves are powerful.\r",
        "Your Pokémon will be at my mercy\n",
        "when they are frozen solid.\r",
        "Hahaha!\n",
        "Are you ready?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_RematchIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Pokémon League.\r",
        "I, Lorelei of the Elite Four,\n",
        "have returned!\r",
        "You know how it goes.\n",
        "No one can best me when it comes\f",
        "to icy Pokémon.\r",
        "Freezing moves are powerful.\r",
        "Your Pokémon will be at my mercy\n",
        "when they are frozen solid.\r",
        "Hahaha!\n",
        "Are you ready?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
